WEBVTT

00:19:59.646 --> 00:20:01.781
If America does it,
other people will follow.

00:20:01.805 --> 00:20:03.201
It's incredibly important.

00:20:03.577 --> 00:20:04.645
(Audience) Yeah!

00:20:04.669 --> 00:20:10.300
(Applause)

00:20:10.324 --> 00:20:11.602
When I was in Huntington,

00:20:11.626 --> 00:20:14.250
trying to get a few things to work
when they weren't,

00:20:14.274 --> 00:20:19.585
I thought "If I had a magic wand,
what would I do?"

00:20:19.609 --> 00:20:21.166
And I thought, "You know what?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:24.473
I'd just love to be put in front
of some of the most amazing

00:20:24.497 --> 00:20:26.261
movers and shakers in America."

00:20:27.181 --> 00:20:30.268
And a month later, TED phoned me up
and gave me this award.